<p>{% trans %}A Name field on user accounts can be used for display names. This changes how names appear on the site.{% endtrans %}</p>

<p>{% trans %}This does not change the account login name. It only changes the shown display name.{% endtrans %}</p>

<h2>{% trans %}How to use it{% endtrans %}</h2>
<ol>
  <li>{% trans %}Add a Name field to user accounts.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Enable the setting to use this field for user display names.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Choose the format used for the display name.{% endtrans %}</li>
  <li>{% trans %}Clear caches if old names still appear.{% endtrans %}</li>
</ol>
